  "description": "Add a royal touch to your projects with this Cute Princess Girls Clipart Set. It’s a cheerful collection of cartoon princesses with friendly smiles, big bright eyes and gorgeous ball gowns. The colorful palette of pink, blue, orange and green, along with sparkly details like bows, polka dots and ruffles, gives each princess her own sweet personality.\nWhat’s inside:\nEight cute princess characters, each as a full-body illustration\nA variety of hairstyles, including blonde, brunette, auburn and black hair\nBeautiful gowns in pink, blue, orange and green with ruffles, bows and dotted patterns\nDifferent friendly poses, including waving and hands-on-hips looks\nEach princess as its own separate graphic, so you can mix, layer and resize freely\nFile formats included:\nPNG: transparent background, ready to place into your layouts\nSVG: scalable vector for Cricut, Silhouette and other cutting machines\nPerfect for:\nPrincess birthday party invitations and decor\nBaby showers and nursery wall art\nClassroom activities and teaching materials\nCake toppers, party favors and gift tags\nT-shirts, mugs and sublimation crafts\nStickers, planners, scrapbooking and greeting cards\nPlease note: This is a digital download. No physical item will be shipped.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Add a royal touch to your projects with this Cute Princess Girls Clipart Set. It’s a cheerful collection of cartoon princesses with friendly smiles, big bright eyes and gorgeous ball gowns. The colorful palette of pink, blue, orange and green, along with sparkly details like bows, polka dots and ruffles, gives each princess her own sweet personality.</p>\n<p>What’s inside:</p>\n<p>Eight cute princess characters, each as a full-body illustration<br>\nA variety of hairstyles, including blonde, brunette, auburn and black hair<br>\nBeautiful gowns in pink, blue, orange and green with ruffles, bows and dotted patterns<br>\nDifferent friendly poses, including waving and hands-on-hips looks<br>\nEach princess as its own separate graphic, so you can mix, layer and resize freely</p>\n<p>File formats included:</p>\n<p>PNG: transparent background, ready to place into your layouts<br>\nSVG: scalable vector for Cricut, Silhouette and other cutting machines</p>\n<p>Perfect for:</p>\n<p>Princess birthday party invitations and decor<br>\nBaby showers and nursery wall art<br>\nClassroom activities and teaching materials<br>\nCake toppers, party favors and gift tags<br>\nT-shirts, mugs and sublimation crafts<br>\nStickers, planners, scrapbooking and greeting cards</p>\n<p>Please note: This is a digital download. No physical item will be shipped.</p>",
